WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:19.597
Danny: That was easy.

2
00:00:19.598 --> 00:00:23.053
Brad: We're lucky no one noticed us.

3
00:00:23.054 --> 00:00:28.114
Danny: I think the mites are too busy to notice anything.

4
00:00:28.115 --> 00:00:31.071
Brad: They're turning around!

5
00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:36.398
Let's get to that bench before they notice us.

6
00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:38.220
Danny: Get down and crawl.

7
00:00:38.221 --> 00:00:45.331
Brad: Whatever you say!

8
00:00:45.332 --> 00:00:47.488
Danny: The mites are everywhere.

9
00:00:47.489 --> 00:00:50.067
We need another distraction.

10
00:00:50.068 --> 00:01:00.523
Brad: I don't have my computer.

11
00:01:00.524 --> 00:01:02.926
Danny: We don't need your computer.

12
00:01:02.927 --> 00:01:04.726
I've got a plan.

13
00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:07.189
Brad: What are you going to do with that?

14
00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:10.897
Danny: I'm going to throw this stone and hit that bell.

15
00:01:10.898 --> 00:01:15.739
Brad: Where?

16
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.334
Brad: There's no way you can hit that!

17
00:01:18.335 --> 00:01:21.348
Danny: I just have to visualize my throw first.

18
00:01:21.349 --> 00:01:23.606
That's the key.

19
00:01:23.607 --> 00:01:26.892
Brad: You mean you are going to use your imagination?

20
00:01:26.893 --> 00:01:30.063
Danny: Exactly!

21
00:01:30.064 --> 00:01:42.590
Danny: I just need one huge, super-strong throw.

22
00:01:42.591 --> 00:01:44.983
Brad: Um . . . Danny?

23
00:01:44.984 --> 00:01:45.987
Danny: What?

24
00:01:45.988 --> 00:01:48.239
Brad: You should throw the rock soon.

25
00:01:48.240 --> 00:02:01.592
Danny: Oh yeah, right.

26
00:02:01.593 --> 00:02:03.303
Brad: You did it!

27
00:02:03.304 --> 00:02:07.838
Danny: It was not exactly the way I imagined, but it worked.

28
00:02:07.839 --> 00:02:16.201
Brad: Let's rescue Chuck and Dave!

29
00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.087
Brad: This is weird.

30
00:02:18.088 --> 00:02:19.357
Danny: What?

31
00:02:19.358 --> 00:02:22.359
Brad: This tower is completely deserted.

32
00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:25.577
Brad: I was sure there would be guards here.

33
00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:27.940
Danny: Don't complain because it's easy.

34
00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.776
I like easy!

35
00:02:29.777 --> 00:02:32.478
Brad: Okay. Let's keep climbing!

36
00:02:32.479 --> 00:02:40.397
Danny: Last one up is a rotten egg!

37
00:02:40.398 --> 00:02:43.104
Danny: You don't suppose it's open, do you?

38
00:02:43.105 --> 00:02:45.962
Brad: I wish.

39
00:02:45.963 --> 00:02:47.466
Brad: It's open!

40
00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:57.372
Danny: It's time to be heroes.

41
00:02:57.373 --> 00:02:59.048
Danny: They're not there!

42
00:02:59.049 --> 00:03:04.124
Brad: They must be in another tower!

43
00:03:04.125 --> 00:03:06.760
Danny: Which tower are they in?

44
00:03:06.761 --> 00:03:09.924
Brad: They aren't in a tower anymore.

45
00:03:09.925 --> 00:03:11.470
Danny: How do you know that?

46
00:03:11.471 --> 00:03:13.171
Brad: Look!

47
00:03:13.172 --> 00:03:18.397
Danny: What's going on down there?

48
00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:22.554
Brad: The mites are giving Chuck and Dave to those ants!

49
00:03:22.555 --> 00:03:25.485
Danny: What are the ants going to do with them?

50
00:03:25.486 --> 00:03:29.037
Brad: I don't know!
